When did you start feeling so sorry for yourself?

01:36:16.720 --> 01:36:18.600
It's unbearable. What?

01:36:19.190 --> 01:36:22.560
So you think we might have put a few people out of business today.

01:36:22.650 --> 01:36:24.520
That's all for naught.

01:36:25.440 --> 01:36:29.490
But you've been doing that every day for almost 40 years, Sam.

01:36:30.780 --> 01:36:34.710
And if this is all for naught, then so is everything out there.

01:36:37.450 --> 01:36:39.170
It's just money.

01:36:39.790 --> 01:36:41.380
It's made up,

01:36:42.380 --> 01:36:43.800
pieces of paper with pictures on it

01:36:43.880 --> 01:36:47.800
so that we don't have to kill each other just to get something to eat.

01:36:48.380 --> 01:36:49.880
It's not wrong.

01:36:50.380 --> 01:36:53.560
And it's certainly no different today than it's ever been.

01:36:54.930 --> 01:36:57.810
1637, 1797,

01:36:57.890 --> 01:37:02.270
1819,1837, 1857,1884,

01:37:04.190 --> 01:37:06.240
1901, 1907,

01:37:06.690 --> 01:37:09.740
1929, 1937, 1974,

01:37:10.530 --> 01:37:13.580
1987, Jesus. Didn't that fucker fuck me up good.

01:37:13.660 --> 01:37:16.790
1992, 1997, 2000, and whatever we want to call this.

01:37:16.870 --> 01:37:20.790
It's all just the same thing, over and over. We can't help ourselves.

01:37:21.620 --> 01:37:25.240
And you and I can't control it

01:37:25.250 --> 01:37:28.130
or stop it or even slow it.

01:37:28.210 --> 01:37:30.470
Or even ever so slightly alter it.

01:37:31.420 --> 01:37:32.970
We just react.

01:37:33.840 --> 01:37:36.140
And we make a lot of money if we get it right.

01:37:36.220 --> 01:37:39.190
And we get left by the side of the road if we get it wrong.

01:37:39.270 --> 01:37:41.110
And there have always been and there always will be

01:37:41.180 --> 01:37:42.860
the same percentage of winners and losers,

01:37:42.940 --> 01:37:44.280
happy fucks and sad sacks,

01:37:44.350 --> 01:37:47.150
fat cats and starving dogs in this world.

01:37:49.190 --> 01:37:50.280
Yeah.

01:37:51.780 --> 01:37:54.810
There may be more of us today than there's ever been.

01:37:54.820 --> 01:37:58.250
But the percentages, they stay exactly the same.

01:38:17.760 --> 01:38:21.630
I'll do it, John, but not because of your little speech.

01:38:21.640 --> 01:38:23.860
But because I need the money.

01:38:25.230 --> 01:38:29.860
Hard to believe after all these years, but I need the money.

01:38:33.320 --> 01:38:34.540
This is the executive dining room.

01:38:34.610 --> 01:38:37.240
- Do you want coffee or tea? - No.

01:38:41.450 --> 01:38:43.420
You gonna keep the kid?

01:38:44.910 --> 01:38:47.340
Keep him? He's getting promoted.

01:38:48.170 --> 01:38:50.010
It's all hands on deck now, Sam.

01:38:50.090 --> 01:38:52.500
There's going to be a lot of money to be made coming out of this mess,

01:38:52.510 --> 01:38:56.230
and we're gonna need all the brains we can get around here.

01:40:20.430 --> 01:40:21.770
Hello.

01:40:23.220 --> 01:40:24.940
I've called the police.

01:40:25.010 --> 01:40:26.190
Mary.

01:40:26.850 --> 01:40:28.350
- Sam. - Yep.

01:40:31.190 --> 01:40:32.940
What are you doing?

01:40:48.910 --> 01:40:50.880
Sam, what are you doing?

01:40:53.000 --> 01:40:54.550
Ella died.

01:41:20.150 --> 01:41:24.620
I was driving home from the vet and I couldn't think of where else to go.

01:41:26.120 --> 01:41:28.920
- She belongs here. - I know.

01:41:29.000 --> 01:41:31.290
But, Sam, you don't live here anymore.

01:41:37.460 --> 01:41:39.180
Are you all right?

01:41:40.340 --> 01:41:42.260
You don't look so good.

01:41:44.050 --> 01:41:46.220
Yeah, it's been a rough day all the way around.

01:41:46.300 --> 01:41:48.100
I know, Sammy called.

01:41:48.510 --> 01:41:49.560
Is he all right?

01:41:49.640 --> 01:41:52.690
They got hammered, but they got out alive.

01:41:52.770 --> 01:41:53.860
Good.

01:42:01.690 --> 01:42:04.120
Well, I'm gonna go back inside

01:42:06.280 --> 01:42:07.750
and go back to bed.

01:42:08.950 --> 01:42:11.830
The alarm is on, so don't try and break in.

01:42:21.210 --> 01:42:23.090
Take care of yourself.
